    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 Years after graduating from the university where you were bullied relentlessly, you get fired from your job. After living on the streets for weeks, you're attacked by the woman who tormented you back in university, except...it's not her, but actually her daughter that looks exactly like her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you tell the sadistic mother and daughter duo that you're currently homeless, they invite you to stay with them, but it soon becomes obvious that they both have their own sadistic and sexual plans for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Sana and her MILFY mother mercilessly tease you with their bodies and waste no time in hiding the fact that they want to use you to &quot;pleasure&quot; themselves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is part 1 in the series. This game focuses on your relationship with Sana and your history with Sanada and her friends 21 years ago</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546720/extras/3d4c265f4cfcb378db2e4817d85878cf.webp?t=1750314370\" width=607 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546720/extras/70c9d30f39d857d6e152e6f947a29dbf.avif?t=1750314370\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546720/extras/d94dccf060611f1c2a77c421280f2f22.avif?t=1750314370\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546720/extras/719a2fb19cb1461a0bbbc1b